### 📋 Phase 3: User Story 1 — Soft-delete Cliente with Undo & Freemium (P1 - MVP)
**Goal**: Allow cliente deletion and restoration while preserving debt validation and freemium counts

**Independent Test**: Delete cliente without debt → verify disappears → confirm undo restores immediately → verify deleted clientes don't count in freemium limit

#### Tests (T009-T011)
- [ ] T009 Soft-delete cliente service tests (database.service.spec.ts): logical delete, restore, filtering
- [ ] T010 Freemium gating tests (freemium.service.spec.ts): deleted clientes excluded from counts
- [ ] T011 UI flow tests (home.page.spec.ts): delete confirmation, hidden row, undo handling

#### Implementation (T012-T017)
- [x] T012 Soft-delete methods: `softDeleteCliente()`, `restoreCliente()` implemented in database.service.ts
- [x] T013 Query filtering: `obtenerClientes()` uses `WHERE deleted_at IS NULL` ✅
- [ ] T014 Freemium service: Update `contarClientes()` to exclude deleted clientes
  - **File**: `src/app/core/freemium/freemium.service.ts`
  - **Action**: Verify `contarClientes()` uses active count only
- [ ] T015 UI: Hide soft-deleted clientes, trigger delete, expose undo
  - **Files**: `src/app/home/home.page.ts`, `src/app/home/home.page.html`
  - **Action**: Add delete confirmation, hide row on soft-delete, show undo snackbar (5s or nav-away)
- [ ] T016 Debt restriction: Prevent delete if cliente has active debt
  - **File**: `src/app/home/home.page.ts`
  - **Action**: Check `deuda > 0` before soft-delete
- [ ] T017 Detail & refresh consistency
  - **File**: `src/app/features/cliente-detalle/cliente-detalle.page.ts`
  - **Action**: Handle delete/undo in detail view, refresh after undo

**Checkpoint**: User Story 1 fully functional and independently testable

---

### 📋 Phase 4: User Story 2 — Soft-delete Transaccion with Undo & Balance Recalc (P2)
**Goal**: Allow transaccion deletion and restoration with correct balance calculations

**Independent Test**: Delete transaccion → verify disappears and balance updates → undo immediately → balance returns to previous

#### Tests (T018-T020)
- [ ] T018 Soft-delete transaccion service tests (database.service.spec.ts): logical delete, restore, balance filtering
- [ ] T019 Balance calculation tests (cliente-detalle.page.spec.ts): deleted transacciones excluded from debt
- [ ] T020 UI flow tests (cliente-detalle.page.spec.ts): delete, undo, recalculated totals

#### Implementation (T021-T025)
- [x] T021 Soft-delete methods: `softDeleteTransaccion()`, `restoreTransaccion()` implemented in database.service.ts
- [x] T022 Query filtering: `obtenerTransaccionesPorCliente()` uses `WHERE deleted_at IS NULL` ✅
- [ ] T023 UI: Hide deleted transacciones, trigger delete, expose undo
  - **File**: `src/app/features/cliente-detalle/cliente-detalle.page.ts`, template
  - **Action**: Add delete confirmation, hide row on soft-delete, show undo snackbar (5s or nav-away)
- [ ] T024 Balance recalculation: Only include active transacciones
  - **File**: `src/app/features/cliente-detalle/cliente-detalle.page.ts`
  - **Action**: Calculate balance from active transacciones only after delete/undo
- [ ] T025 Summary views refresh
  - **Files**: `src/app/home/home.page.ts`, `src/app/features/configuraciones/configuraciones.page.ts`
  - **Action**: Refresh totals after transaccion delete/undo

**Checkpoint**: User Stories 1 & 2 fully functional

