### 📋 Phase 5: User Story 3 — Immediate Undo for Recent Deletes (P3)
**Goal**: Allow undo of most recent delete while staying in current context (no nav/restart survival)

**Independent Test**: Delete cliente/transaccion → tap undo immediately → record returns → derived counts restore

#### Tests (T026-T027)
- [ ] T026 Undo interaction tests (home.page.spec.ts): immediate restore after cliente delete
- [ ] T027 Undo interaction tests (cliente-detalle.page.spec.ts): immediate restore after transaccion delete

#### Implementation (T028-T031)
- [ ] T028 Undo state holder: Create short-lived context-only service
  - **File**: `src/app/home/undo.service.ts` or `src/app/features/cliente-detalle/undo.service.ts`
  - **Action**: Track last deleted record (cliente_id or transaccion_id) until nav/app-close
- [ ] T029 Wire cliente undo
  - **File**: `src/app/home/home.page.ts`
  - **Action**: Call `restoreCliente()` on undo snackbar action
- [ ] T030 Wire transaccion undo
  - **File**: `src/app/features/cliente-detalle/cliente-detalle.page.ts`
  - **Action**: Call `restoreTransaccion()` on undo snackbar action
- [ ] T031 Refresh totals after undo
  - **Files**: `src/app/home/home.page.ts`, `src/app/features/cliente-detalle/cliente-detalle.page.ts`, `src/app/features/configuraciones/configuraciones.page.ts`

**Checkpoint**: All user stories independently functional

