---

## Notes & Known Issues

- **Web Platform**: Mock implementation uses in-memory arrays; soft-delete behavior matches SQLite queries
- **Foreign Keys**: PRAGMA foreign_keys ON enforced; transaccion delete cascades NOT physical (soft-delete only)
- **Undo Scope**: Undo must NOT survive navigation, app close, or restart; short-lived UI service only
- **Freemium Count**: Must use `contarClientes()` which already filters deleted_at IS NULL ✅

